      "body": "## Summary\n- Align `erdos_10` with [erdosproblems.com/10](https://www.erdosproblems.com/10): the source asks whether some $k$ works for every **large** integer, not for all $n \\notin \\{0,1\\}$.\n- State this as `\u2203 k, \u2200\u1da0 n, n \u2208 sumPrimeAndTwoPows k`.\n- Add small tests for the definition (`2` is a prime, `1` is never representable).\n- Record `[Ga75]` and `[GrSo98]` in the module references.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `lake --wfail build 'FormalConjectures.ErdosProblems.\u00ab10\u00bb'`\n- [x] Category, AMS, and docstring match the source\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>",
